/*****************************************************************************
* Metadata Ext.  : ZZC_FIXEDASSETWL_MDE
* Type           : CDS metadata extension (DDLX)
* Annotates      : C_FixedAssetWorklist  (SAP standard)
* Purpose        : Render "Custodian of Assets" as a column and a filter in
*                  Fiori app F1592 - Display Asset Master Worklist.
* Package        : <customer package, same TR as the extend views>
* Created by     : Arnav
* Created on     : 01.09.2026
*
* NOTE 1 - LAYER.
*   #CUSTOMER sits above SAP's own #CORE / #LOCALIZATION layers, so these
*   annotations win without touching SAP's DDLX. Do not use #CORE.
*
* NOTE 2 - PREREQUISITE ON THE STANDARD VIEW.
*   C_FixedAssetWorklist must carry @Metadata.allowExtensions: true. It does
*   if SAP already ships a DDLX for it (list-report apps normally do). If
*   activation fails with "view does not allow metadata extensions", this
*   route is closed and the annotations have to go into the ZZC_ extend view
*   instead - tell me and I will move them.
*
* NOTE 3 - POSITIONS.
*   900/910 are deliberately high so the column lands at the end of the table
*   and cannot collide with SAP's existing lineItem positions on upgrade.
*
* NOTE 4 - THE COLUMN WILL NOT APPEAR BY ITSELF.
*   @UI.lineItem makes the column AVAILABLE. F1592 users still have to add it
*   via Settings (gear) -> Columns, unless a key-user adaptation changes the
*   default variant. See NOTES.md, "After activation".
*****************************************************************************/

@Metadata.layer: #CUSTOMER

annotate view C_FixedAssetWorklist with
{
  @UI.lineItem:       [ { position: 900, label: 'Custodian of Assets' } ]
  @UI.identification: [ { position: 900, label: 'Custodian of Assets' } ]
  @UI.selectionField: [ { position: 910 } ]
  ZZCustodianOfAssets;
}
